### Read User (Current user's profile)
GET {{safefy_api_HostAddress}}/v1/user
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Change Password (User) - Step 1: Request code
POST {{safefy_api_HostAddress}}/v1/user/change-password
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "NovaSenha123!",
  "newPassword": "NovaSenha1234!"
}

###

### Confirm Change Password (User) - Step 2: Confirm with code
POST {{safefy_api_HostAddress}}/v1/user/confirm-change-password
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "code": "337524"
}

###

### Register Push Token
POST {{safefy_api_HostAddress}}/v1/users/push-tokens
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "token": "your-fcm-token-here",
  "platform": "web",
  "deviceName": "Chrome on Windows"
}

###

### Delete Push Token (Unregister)
DELETE {{safefy_api_HostAddress}}/v1/users/push-tokens
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "token": "your-fcm-token-here"
}

###

### Test Push Notification
POST {{safefy_api_HostAddress}}/v1/users/push-tokens/test
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "🎉 Teste de Notificação",
  "message": "Esta é uma notificação push de teste enviada manualmente!",
  "actionUrl": "/panel/dashboard"
}

###
